{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "1_4_002_09_i",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:aaa4280ae5ca9ee3ed0fbdf6ef4cfd52b40e282710f308892cc917d33fa12100",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_09:1_4_002_09_i:cmd-000026:time_caption:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f0e7dee7459f09cce99ab9493a965de1c45f77d1ae28531c2a551de6cf7ef221",
      "text": "当天夜里……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_09:1_4_002_09_i:cmd-000034:time_caption:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:05517401dd2e8fb64cdcf7e58a617cdb1bd85eb33e24c184790e61f830beaaab",
      "text": "诚司的家",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_09:1_4_002_09_i:cmd-000042:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:8609d4cfe235bb8b8285fe1d3a5204f22e41bef5d179df203ce1a7649e1648f1",
      "text": "事情就是这样，我们俩偶然听到了这番对话。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_09:1_4_002_09_i:cmd-000062:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:79578e012c9e9afe633329b24b69539f38d1871dd884ae3ea618c058f6a04229",
      "text": "嗯——……那确实听上去\n会是一场很可疑的LIVE啊。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_09:1_4_002_09_i:cmd-000078:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:8a07264254816bbef4f46be762e7dd3a7185ec4983d958aff84f89762d560733",
      "text": "男极也是在满是可疑名堂的情况下收场的，\n听说这回可能比那次还要过分呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_09:1_4_002_09_i:cmd-000082:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:58fd154f8c6b8469f7b6c8b9cd6f5d6d36094bf2abd3e59dd5c5e78ee42818b6",
      "text": "只不过，综合考虑之后……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_09:1_4_002_09_i:cmd-000085:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:bf2e01b34252b93f3901e10a0edd4d235e879aa35c30ef4476007f526ff66cf5",
      "text": "我打算找制作人商量，\n参加这场LIVE。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_09:1_4_002_09_i:cmd-000090:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:958d58afd9084ce22e879166df9ef949f7638039907eeb16adaf87b35ab8bfe3",
      "text": "因为本以为已经错失的挑战机会，\n如今又重新出现在了眼前。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_09:1_4_002_09_i:cmd-000096:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:19636a36c459a0bf84ead35d6ef56a42fdb1035983b4fb22964a1cb4e24ccf20",
      "text": "……他是这么说的。其他人打算怎么办？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_09:1_4_002_09_i:cmd-000117:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:88645271d33398db464e220c50d6ac9915a01569e4872424ad5a4b9f9de2ebf3",
      "text": "当然，我也要参加！\n毕竟那封信的回礼，我还没送完呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_09:1_4_002_09_i:cmd-000122:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:5429463d5bac4b7848144f6aa98cb94d9b88bbd1fb5b6f1328da9bc630d0f1c4",
      "text": "啊，“我会全力把你们打得落花流水，\n洗干净脖子等着吧！”……那封信啊。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_09:1_4_002_09_i:cmd-000128:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f06e77fcfeed307aa84cded14b282cebe1a8776f13da5e676412dac46f1b357b",
      "text": "对对。本来以为能大干一场，\n结果男极就这么结束了，我还挺扫兴的。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_09:1_4_002_09_i:cmd-000133:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:9176eb057345a0dcdc552d86d324e09d8099fb234778fe781005ab3cff4b4701",
      "text": "得参加那场LIVE，\n这次一定要让他们好好奉陪到底才行！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_09:1_4_002_09_i:cmd-000142:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b980557dafdf5e70f00fb5c8299d12d69d734fd7feb157dc46ef53be105e8270",
      "text": "哈哈，也是啊。既然对方挑起了胜负，\n就得碰撞到彼此都满意为止才行啊！",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
